ation and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Conditional Sentences with If Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the conditional sentences with modals to talk about what might happen in a certain situation.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "There are two parts to the sentence. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "One part is the <span class=\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class=\"strong\">result</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form:<br/>(If  or When + Subject + Present Tense), (Subject + Modal + Object)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In this structure, a comma is placed between the condition and the result.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can change the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "(Subject + Modal + Object) (If  or When + Subject + Present Tense)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In this structure, there is no comma between the result and the condition.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If we turn the knob, we can advance the paper manually.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It might tear and get stuck if you pull the paper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If we open the top cover, we could see if anything is jammed. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Describing a Simple Technical Problem", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Here is a list of common technical problems related to office equipment, such as a photocopier, printer or a fax machine:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Something is jammed.<br/>Something is stuck.<br/>There is a (paper) jam.<br/>The control panel is off (not working).<br/>The network buttons are off (not working).<br/>It's making a strange noise.<br/>There is an error message on the control panel.<br/>I can't open the top cover.<br/>The lever is not working.<br/>I'm not sure where the instruction manual is.<br/>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fax machine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "equipment used to copy and send documents electronically", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The fax machine seems to be making a strange noise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about a technical problem.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "paper jam", "type": "name"}, {"content": "problem in which a paper cannot be removed from a piece of office equipment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Perhaps there is a paper jam somewhere. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "lever", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device used to turn or move part of a machine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Here is the lever to turn the paper roll.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "network", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a series of points of contact that are connected, usually electronically (such as the Internet)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The network buttons are correct.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "instruction manual", "type": "name"}, {"content": "document that explains how a machine works", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm not sure where the instruction 